flowchart TD
    accTitle: BlaBla agent workflow
    accDescr: An agent starts from the AGENTS.md block, runs blabla status, sees which layer and which rules need attention, runs blabla explain on one rule, edits the implementation, and runs blabla finish. RED or YELLOW leads back to editing; OVERALL GREEN is the only completion signal.
    agents["AGENTS.md block<br/>Start with: blabla status"]
    status["blabla status<br/>BEHAVIOR · STRUCTURE · OVERALL"]
    layer["the layer that is not GREEN<br/>and its Next rules"]
    explain["blabla explain &lt;rule&gt;<br/>counterexample or observed structural fact"]
    edit["edit the implementation<br/>never the contracts"]
    finish["blabla finish<br/>VERIFYING → progress → verdict"]
    red["RED or YELLOW<br/>NOT COMPLETE"]
    green["OVERALL GREEN<br/>completion"]
    agents --> status --> layer --> explain --> edit --> finish
    finish --> red --> explain
    finish --> green
